{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Without a reading: the read-back schedule for every open experiment and a routine prompt for a host scheduler (Claude Code scheduled task or cron), set up only if the owner agrees. With a reading: compares it with the registered baseline, minimum volume and guardrails; flags a guardrail breach at once; after the window, returns an honest verdict and the close payload for record_outcome_experiment. Budget and pause ideas come back as proposals for the owner; nothing is ever changed.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"engagement":{"description":"The complete engagement.json from the last outcome tool result, unchanged.","type":"object"},"engagement_sha256":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"experiments":{"description":"The text of experiments.jsonl.","maxLength":100000,"type":"string"},"reading":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"at":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"experiment_id":{"pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,79}$","type":"string"},"guardrails":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"held":{"type":"boolean"},"limit":{"type":"number"},"name":{"maxLength":300,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"note":{"maxLength":500,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"number"},"worse_if":{"enum":["above","below"],"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"min_effect":{"maximum":0.99,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"note":{"maxLength":1000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"observed":{"type":"number"},"source":{"description":"Where the numbers were read, read-only.","maxLength":300,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"spend":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cap":{"type":"number"},"to_date":{"type":"number"}},"required":["to_date","cap"],"type":"object"},"volume":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["experiment_id","at","observe